storyboard, generate shots on parallel branches, and assemble takes in the built-in multi-track editor. Advertising and campaign teams build a graph per concept, then fan the approved one out to every placement and aspect ratio. E-commerce teams reuse one product photo as a reference node across lifestyle scenes and crops. Brand and design teams pin assets, fonts, and references as nodes so downstream generations stay on-brand, and agencies share canvases so feedback lands on a specific node rather than a finished file.")]},{_key:"home-faq-how-video-works",question:"How does AI video generation work on Melius?",answer:[(0,r.p)("You start from a text prompt or an existing image, choose a video model or let Mel pick one, and Melius generates the clip. You can guide it with reference images, first and last frames, or input footage, then trim and assemble clips in the built-in video editor.")]},{_key:"home-faq-is-free",question:"Is Melius free?",answer:[(0,r.p)(`You can create a Melius account for free, but generating images, video, or audio uses credits — and the only way to get credits is a paid plan or a one-time credit purchase. So it's free to sign up and explore, and you pay only for what you generate. Paid plans start at ${n} per month.`)]},{_key:"home-faq-models",question:"What AI models does Melius support?",answer:[(0,r.p)("Melius gives you access to a library of leading AI models for image, video, audio, and text. That includes image models like Nano Banana, GPT Image, Flux, Seedream, and Ideogram; video models like Seedance, Veo, Sora, and Kling; and audio and voice models like ElevenLabs, from providers including OpenAI, Google, ByteDance, and Black Forest Labs. The Mel agent can choose the best model for your prompt automatically, or you can pick one yourself.")]},{_key:"home-faq-ownership",question:"Who owns the content I create, and can I use it commercially?",answer:[(0,r.p)("You own the content you create on Melius and can use, publish, and distribute it commercially, subject to the underlying model providers' terms. Melius doesn't claim ownership of your work and doesn't use it to train AI models.")]},{_key:"home-faq-vs-single-tool",question:"How is Melius different from single-model tools like Midjourney?",answer:[(0,r.p)("A single-model tool gives you one model and one output at a time, with no record of how you got there. Melius is a node-based canvas: one subscription covers many models across image, video, and audio, and the graph keeps every step connected, editable, and re-runnable. You can swap the model on a single node, branch to compare two directions, and reuse the whole workflow as a template, instead of juggling several separate tools and rebuilding the process from scratch each time.")]}]},l={creator:{cta:{ctaLabel:"Start with Creator",ctaColor:"orange"},decoration:null,size:"default"},growth:{cta:{ctaLabel:"Start with Growth",ctaColor:"orange"},decoration:null,size:"default"},professional:{cta:{ctaLabel:"Start with Professional",ctaColor:"gradient"},decoration:"indentCoin",size:"default"},enterprise:{cta:{ctaLabel:"Contact Sales",ctaLink:"/book-intro",ctaColor:"black"},decoration:"indentCoin",size:"wide"}},c={header:{signInLink:{url:"https://app.melius.com/login",label:"Sign In",isNewTab:!1},startFreeLink:{url:"https://app.melius.com/signup",label:"Start for Free",isNewTab:!1}},hero:{title:{prefix:"Create any",words:["image","audio","video","campaign","movie"],suffix:"you imagine",accessibleTitle:"Create anything you imagine"},description:"AI agents for creative work.\nBring your creative vision and collaborate with AI agents until the images, video, and audio land exactly as you imagined.",menuSlug:{current:"hero"},animation:{images:Array.from({length:24},(e,t)=>({asset:{_ref:`image-hero${t+1}-670x670-webp`},src:`/images/hero/hero-${t+1}.webp`}))}},personas:{title:"Personas",menuSlug:{current:"personas"},cards:[{_key:"agencies",name:"Agencies",slug:"agencies",title:"Agencies",description:"Concep